# Normalized copies of the sources this wiki was distilled from. They stay local and are never
# published: they are verbatim third-party text, and redistributing them is not ours to do.
# Nothing at runtime reads them — the agents read wiki/ and SCHEMA.md — so their absence costs
# a consumer nothing. Page citations name their source; the source itself you obtain yourself.
raw/

# Source provenance for lint (origin + sha256), regenerated by the llm-wiki Stop hook from
# raw/ frontmatter. Derived, and not part of what the plugin ships.
.manifest.json

# Obsidian workspace state — local editor layout, not part of the knowledge base.
.obsidian/

# Note: wiki/index.md IS committed here, unlike in a standalone wiki. It is the catalog the
# guide agent searches from, so it has to travel with the plugin. Regenerate it before
# releasing (the Stop hook only fires when the working directory is inside this wiki).
